{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11207340","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11207340","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120733001:":{"text":"你们可给我想清楚了","source_cn":"你们可给我想清楚了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE684AFB66C0C6EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120733002:":{"text":"这是最后一次机会！","source_cn":"这是最后一次机会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2515C84E609B497","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120734001:0":{"text":"这是我最后一次警告你，<style=\"highlight\">奇克</style>。","source_cn":"这是我最后一次警告你，<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8931044DA8CCD17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120734002:0":{"text":"流沙之爪迟早会有新首领——那就是我，鲁斯！你要是现在投诚加入，还来得及协助我击败吉维尔，当上首领！","source_cn":"流沙之爪迟早会有新首领——那就是我，鲁斯！你要是现在投...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345C26468D2C13BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120734003:0":{"text":"但要是不知好歹，就别怪我不顾念以前的情分了！","source_cn":"但要是不知好歹，就别怪我不顾念以前的情分了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x990A8E0391D9DC3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120734004:0":{"text":"奇……奇克，你、你要答应他吗……","source_cn":"奇……奇克，你、你要答应他吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D6C9735FC2AC958","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120734005:1":{"text":"不。","source_cn":"不。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC74AE3C4604443D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120734006:0":{"text":"我说过了，我和卢玛有自己的路要走。流沙之爪也不能再重复之前的覆辙。","source_cn":"我说过了，我和卢玛有自己的路要走。流沙之爪也不能再重复...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCADC39ED22D02ED2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120734007:0":{"text":"所以无论是你还是吉维尔，我都不会帮的！","source_cn":"所以无论是你还是吉维尔，我都不会帮的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DCCD25BB401DE93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120734008:0":{"text":"好，那就别怪我不念旧情，提前扼杀风险了——","source_cn":"好，那就别怪我不念旧情，提前扼杀风险了——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD4D75988E57C708","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120734009:0":{"text":"那些流沙之爪，要对卢玛他们动手！","source_cn":"那些流沙之爪，要对卢玛他们动手！","status":"matched_runtime_gender",